Package: bambaganaCI
Title: Confidence Intervals and Classical Statistical Inference
Version: 0.3.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Silas", "Bambil", , "sbambil1@student.gsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Yasmeen", "Babagana", email = "ybabagana1@student.gsu.edu", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Provides confidence intervals, tests, descriptive summaries,
    association measures, classical linear-model inference, analysis of variance,
    and model-based power planning. Retains bootstrap inference for a population
    mean and adds validated interfaces to established statistical methods in R.
    Documents method assumptions and preserves reference warnings.
